ground_truth.question:
Express the following in the form of \( a + bi \):
\begin{enumerate}
    \item \( \left( -5i \right) \left( \frac{1}{8} i \right) \)
    \item \( \left( -i \right) \left( 2i \right) \left( \frac{-1}{8} i \right)^3 \)
\end{enumerate}

