\begin{document}
**Question:** Express the following in the form of $a+bi$:

1. $(−5i)(\frac{1}{8}i)$

2. $(-i)(2i)(-\frac{1}{8}i)^{3}$

**Answer:** 

1. $(−5i)\left(\frac{1}{8}i\right)= -\frac{5}{8}j^{2}=-\frac{5}{8}(-1)=\frac{5}{8}= \frac{5}{8} + j0$

2. $(-i)(2i)(-\frac{1}{8}i)^{3}=2\times \frac{1}{8\times 8\times 8}\times i^{5}=\frac{1}{256}(i^{2})^{2}$

